---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Section from '../components/ui/Section.astro';
import Hero from '../components/ui/Hero.astro';
import { responsive } from '../lib/responsive';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy - Fund Investigator"
  description="Privacy Policy for Fund Investigator"
>
  <Hero size="sm" centered={false}>
    <h1 class:list={[responsive.display, 'font-bold text-fi-ink mb-4 leading-tight']}>
      Privacy Policy
    </h1>
    <p class:list={[responsive.subtitle, 'text-fi-muted']}>
      Last updated: July 16, 2026
    </p>
  </Hero>

  <Section background="white" spacing="md" maxWidth="md">
    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none text-fi-muted space-y-8">

      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class:list={[responsive.h2, 'font-bold text-fi-ink mb-6']}>1. Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>
          Fund Investigator collects minimal information necessary to provide our service. This includes usage data such as pages visited and features accessed to improve the user experience.
        </p>
        <p>
          If you subscribe to Fund Investigator, you enter your email address on Substack rather than on this website. Substack provides us with the subscriber information needed to operate the publication, including your email address, subscription status, and any name associated with your subscription.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class:list={[responsive.h2, 'font-bold text-fi-ink mt-12 mb-6']}>2. How We Use Information</h2>
        <p>
          Information collected is used solely to:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 ml-4">
          <li>Provide and improve our analytical tools and services</li>
          <li>Understand usage patterns to enhance user experience</li>
          <li>Respond to user inquiries and support requests</li>
          <li>Send subscribed users investigation briefs, new-investigation notices, and tool updates</li>
          <li>Understand newsletter delivery and subscriber engagement</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class:list={[responsive.h2, 'font-bold text-fi-ink mt-12 mb-6']}>3. Data Sources</h2>
        <p>
          All mutual fund data displayed on Fund Investigator is sourced from publicly available AMFI (Association of Mutual Funds in India) data. We do not collect or store personal financial information.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class:list={[responsive.h2, 'font-bold text-fi-ink mt-12 mb-6']}>4. Cookies and Tracking</h2>
        <p>
          We use Cloudflare Web Analytics, a privacy-friendly analytics service that does not use cookies or collect personal information. This service tracks anonymous pageviews and basic usage statistics to help us improve the website. It does not identify individual users or track behavior across websites.
        </p>
        <p>
          We also use PostHog, a product analytics service, to understand how visitors use the site and the Fund Deepdive tool. PostHog uses cookies and tracks pageviews, clicks, and other interactions. Because Fund Investigator and Fund Deepdive share the fundinvestigator.com domain, PostHog can follow a visitor's activity across both fundinvestigator.com and deepdive.fundinvestigator.com to understand how the site drives use of the tool.
        </p>
        <p>
          Following a subscription link takes you to Substack, which has its own cookies and tracking practices described in <a href="https://substack.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-fi-ink hover:text-fi-gold font-medium underline">Substack's Privacy Policy</a>.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class:list={[responsive.h2, 'font-bold text-fi-ink mt-12 mb-6']}>5. Data Sharing</h2>
        <p>
          We do not sell, trade, or rent user information to third parties. Newsletter subscriptions are processed by Substack, our newsletter and subscription provider. Substack makes subscriber information available to us so we can deliver the publication and manage subscription requests. We do not share personal information except as required by law or with service providers needed to operate the site and publication.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class:list={[responsive.h2, 'font-bold text-fi-ink mt-12 mb-6']}>6. Subscription Choices and Retention</h2>
        <p>
          You can unsubscribe using the link in any newsletter or manage your subscription through Substack. We retain subscriber information only for as long as needed to operate the publication, honour unsubscribe requests, and meet legal obligations. You may contact us to request access to, correction of, or deletion of the subscriber information we control.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class:list={[responsive.h2, 'font-bold text-fi-ink mt-12 mb-6']}>7. Data Security</h2>
        <p>
          We implement reasonable security measures to protect information. However, no method of transmission over the internet is completely secure.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class:list={[responsive.h2, 'font-bold text-fi-ink mt-12 mb-6']}>8. Changes to Privacy Policy</h2>
        <p>
          We may update this Privacy Policy periodically. Changes will be posted on this page with an updated revision date.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class:list={[responsive.h2, 'font-bold text-fi-ink mt-12 mb-6']}>9. Contact</h2>
        <p>
          For questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact us at <a href="mailto:contact@fundinvestigator.com" class="text-fi-ink hover:text-fi-gold font-medium">contact@fundinvestigator.com</a>
        </p>
      </section>

    </div>
  </Section>
</Layout>
